\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Lions of faith, make your appearance
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 As in early Christendom;
\par Overcoming with assurance
\par Even suffering martydom .
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par When with burning love aglowing,
\par Sacred fire on all bestowing,
\par Satan trembles, filled with fright,
\par \i ://:Even unto death they fight.://:
\par \pard\li180\sl40\slmult0\i0 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Facing danger and temptation,
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0\qj Free from mean and evil lust;
\par Steadfast in God's congregation
\par Shunning vain and base distrust.
\par \pard\li135\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li135\sl202\slmult0\qj  These souls longed for peace and heaven
\par  Not for this world's worthless leaven;
\par  Lifted up in heart and mind,
\par \i  ://:Timely things were left behind://:\i0 
\par \pard\li135\sl40\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-135\li135\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  What the world thought advantageous,
\par \pard\li135\sl202\slmult0\qj   They cast out and laughed to scorn.
\par   Riches, idle talk outrageous,
\par   By wild lust they were not drawn.
\par \pard\li135\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li135\sl202\slmult0\qj Craven fear did not oppress them,
\par   Nor could vicious beasts distress them.
\par   Joyfully they joined the fight,
\par \pard   :/: Besting satan's  vaunted might. :/:\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

